<view class="page">
  <nav-bar title="注销账号"></nav-bar>

  <scroll-view scroll-y class="content">

    <view class="warn-block">
      <view class="warn-badge">
        <text class="warn-mark">!</text>
      </view>
      <text class="warn-title">注销后以下数据将被永久删除</text>
    </view>

    <card tint="base" ext-class="deletion-card">
      <view class="deletion-list">
        <view class="deletion-row">
          <view class="x-badge"><text class="x-mark">×</text></view>
          <text class="deletion-text">账号信息（昵称、头像、生日、城市等）</text>
        </view>
        <view class="deletion-row">
          <view class="x-badge"><text class="x-mark">×</text></view>
          <text class="deletion-text">所有蛋宝宝的对话记录</text>
        </view>
        <view class="deletion-row">
          <view class="x-badge"><text class="x-mark">×</text></view>
          <text class="deletion-text">蛋宝宝设备绑定关系</text>
        </view>
        <view class="deletion-row">
          <view class="x-badge"><text class="x-mark">×</text></view>
          <text class="deletion-text">成就与成长记录</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </card>

    <card tint="base" ext-class="hardware-card">
      <text class="card-title">关于实体蛋宝宝</text>
      <text class="card-body">注销后设备将解除绑定，回到未激活状态。可用其他账号重新激活，但那将是一只全新的蛋宝宝，原有的对话与记忆不会恢复。</text>
    </card>

    <card tint="tint-green" ext-class="cooldown-card">
      <text class="card-title card-title--green">注意</text>
      <view class="cooldown-list">
        <text class="cooldown-item">· 提交申请后进入 <text class="cooldown-strong">15 天冷静期</text></text>
        <text class="cooldown-item">· 冷静期内重新登录可随时撤销注销</text>
        <text class="cooldown-item">· 15 天后数据将被永久删除，无法恢复</text>
      </view>
    </card>

  </scroll-view>

  <view class="button-bar">
    <app-button text="我已了解，继续注销" variant="danger" bind:tap="onConfirmDeregister"></app-button>
    <app-button text="我再想想" variant="secondary" bind:tap="onCancel"></app-button>
  </view>

</view>
